# Screenshots regenerated by `npm test` / tools/cdp.mjs --shot.
# The curated set in docs/screenshots/ IS committed.
tools/*.png

# Browser profiles and probe directories created by the tooling. Every one of
# these is claimed with a .scoreforge-owned marker so tools/lib/guard.mjs will
# let the run that made it delete it again -- see tools/check-no-unguarded-deletes.mjs.
.tmp/

# Scratch output from the accuracy suite. Regenerate with:
#   npm run fixtures
#   python tools/score_omr.py --write fixtures/accuracy.json
#
# The images and their ground truth ARE committed so the published accuracy
# numbers can be reproduced from a fresh clone.